{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "刃", "id": "刃"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "孝", "id": "孝"}, {"form": "悌", "id": "悌"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "為", "id": "爲"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "鄰", "id": "鄰"}, {"form": "靈", "id": "靈"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.126760535960395, "source": "靈", "target": "在"}, {"weight": 0.706392407309966, "source": "靈", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 0.9295359586241757, "source": "王", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.9295359586241757, "source": "王", "target": "在"}, {"weight": 0.41871033485818504, "source": "王", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 0.5240708505160113, "source": "王", "target": "鄰"}, {"weight": 0.706392407309966, "source": "王", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.013245226750020723, "source": "王", "target": "敵"}, {"weight": 0.013245226750020723, "source": "王", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 1.2172180310759566, "source": "王", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.028148247292285, "source": "敵", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 4.330733340286331, "source": "悌", "target": "孝"}, {"weight": 3.2321210516182215, "source": "悌", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.7212954278522306, "source": "鄰", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.6565846908598023, "source": "鄰", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.2321210516182215, "source": "孝", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.7212954278522306, "source": "行", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.963437510299857, "source": "行", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.7212954278522306, "sourc